abolition (the one-sex franchise will soon be a d. 1.), is a SLIPSHOD EXTENSION.
===
abolition (*the one-sex franchise will soon be a d. l.*), is a ^^SLIPSHOD EXTENSION^^.
>>>

<<<
deal, n. 1. The use of a d. instead of a great or good d.,
===
**deal, n.** 1. The use of *a d.* instead of *a great* or *good d.*,
>>>

<<<
Shaksperian what a deal! can hardly be
===
Shaksperian *what a deal!* can hardly be
