<<<
but with buy, sell, pay, cost, &c., dear is still idiomatic,
===
but with *buy, sell, pay, cost*, &c., *dear* is still idiomatic,
>>>

<<<
attach an UNIDIOMATIC -LY should be resisted.
===
attach an ^^UNIDIOMATIC -LY^^ should be resisted.
